    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stylish one bedroom dual aspect open plan ground floor apartment with a sunny patio and designated car space ideally located next to The Phoenix Park.\r\n\r\nThis charming property features enjoys an open plan living room & dining area with laminate floors, floor to ceiling windows and access to a sunny paved patio. The eye catching south facing kitchen boasts a tiled floor, splashback tiling and plenty of counter & cupboard space. A real hallway with a sizeable storage room and a hotpress leads to the bedroom & bathroom. The double bedroom comes with laminate floors, sophisticated fitted wardrobes and space for a workstation. The generous sized family bathroom has a tiled floor and partially tiled walls. This amazing apartment also benefits from an underground designated car space.\r\n\r\nLongmeadows is an attractive development with a brick façade ideally located on Connyngham Road next to the Phoenix Park. There are plenty of shops, cafes, bars & restaurants in nearby Kilmainham, Islandbridge, Chapelizod & Parkgate Street. The city centre is easily accessible by The Red LUAS line and Dublin Bus. Heuston Station and the new children's hospital at St. James are also within walking distance.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nYear of construction 2004\r\nManagement fees €2088.17\r\nGround floor\r\nDesignated car space\r\nOpen plan & dual aspect\r\nFitted wardrobes\r\nPatio facing Phoenix Park\r\nLaminate floors\r\nStorage room\r\nSought after location"
      },
